{"seq":3,"slug":"optimal-designs","title":"最优设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/analysis/optimal-designs","wordCount":1943,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"最优设计\">最优设计</h1><p>经典的析因、CCD、Box-Behnken 是「现成」设计——几何规整、表格可查，但它们假设因素空间是规整的立方体、运行预算是 2 的幂的倍数。现实经常不配合：某些因素组合物理上不可行、预算恰好只够 14 次、模型里混了连续和分类因素。最优设计放弃「查表」，改为<strong>告诉算法你的模型和约束，让它直接搜出在某个代数准则下最好的那组试验点</strong>。这套思路在 2026 年已是 JMP 自定义设计器、Minitab 最优设计模块的默认引擎，也催生了近十年最受关注的新设计 DSD。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>信息矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^TX</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 是设计的模型矩阵，参数估计的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2(X^TX)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，设计「好不好」就是这个协方差「小不小」。</li>\n<li><strong>最优性准则</strong>：把协方差矩阵压成可优化的标量。D-最优最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(X^TX)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（参数整体估得最准，适合筛选/建模）；I-最优最小化全区域平均预测方差（预测最准，适合响应曲面/找最优）；还有 A-最优、G-最优。</li>\n<li><strong>点交换算法</strong>（point/coordinate exchange）：从随机初始设计出发，反复「换掉一个当前点、换上一个能提升准则的候选点」，从多个随机起点取最好，避免局部最优。</li>\n<li><strong>定义筛选设计</strong>（DSD，definitive screening design）：Jones 与 Nachtsheim 2011 年提出，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次三水平试验同时完成筛选与曲率探测，主效应不被任何二阶效应别名，活跃因素少时自动投影成响应曲面设计。</li>\n<li><strong>选准则即选「你想估准什么」</strong>：关心系数用 D-最优，关心曲面预测用 I-最优。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"信息矩阵与最优性准则\">信息矩阵与最优性准则</h2><p>最优设计的全部数学都围绕一个对象：<strong>信息矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^TX</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 是设计的模型矩阵（每行一个试验点，每列一个模型项）。在标准线性模型下，参数估计的协方差是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat\\beta) = \\sigma^2 (X^TX)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>设计「好不好」就是这个协方差「小不小」。但协方差是个矩阵，把它压成一个可优化的标量需要一个准则。两个最常用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>D-最优</strong>：最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(X^TX)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，等价于最小化参数估计联合置信椭球的体积。直觉是「把参数整体估得最准」，适合<strong>筛选/建模</strong>——你关心系数本身。</li>\n<li><strong>I-最优</strong>（也写作 IV/V-最优）：最小化设计区域上预测方差的平均值。直觉是「让模型在整个区域的预测都准」，适合<strong>优化/响应曲面</strong>——你关心预测出的最优点，而非系数。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>准则</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>几何含义</th>\n<th>最适场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>D-最优</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\det(X^TX)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>参数置信椭球最小</td>\n<td>筛选、估系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I-最优</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 平均预测方差</td>\n<td>全区域预测最准</td>\n<td>响应曲面、找最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A-最优</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\mathrm{tr}[(X^TX)^{-1}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">tr</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>各参数方差之和最小</td>\n<td>关注单个参数精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G-最优</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 最大预测方差</td>\n<td>最坏点预测最准</td>\n<td>保守、控制最差情形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选准则就是选「你到底想估准什么」。这与 <a href=\"response-surface\">响应曲面</a> 里「关心曲面预测」对应 I-最优、与 <a href=\"../designs/factorial-designs\">析因设计</a> 里「关心效应估计」对应 D-最优，逻辑一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选点交换算法\">候选点交换算法</h2><p>给定模型、运行数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、因素范围（含不可行约束），D/I-最优设计是一个组合优化问题：从一堆候选点里挑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个使准则最优。精确解通常不可得，实用算法是<strong>坐标交换/点交换</strong>（coordinate/point exchange）：从随机初始设计出发，反复尝试「换掉一个当前点、换上一个能提升准则的候选点」，直到无法再改进。为避免陷入局部最优，从多个随机起点各跑一遍取最好。</p>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/convex-sets\">优化理论</a> 里的一般组合优化同源，但准则函数（行列式、矩阵迹）有专门的快速更新公式（行列式的秩一更新），使每次交换的评估很廉价。理解这一点能解释为什么最优设计软件能在带约束的不规则区域里秒级生成设计——而这正是经典查表设计做不到的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[指定模型项&lt;br/&gt;+ 运行数 n + 约束] --&gt; B[选最优性准则]&#10;  B --&gt; C{关心什么?}&#10;  C --&gt;|估准系数/筛选| D[D-最优]&#10;  C --&gt;|预测准/找最优| E[I-最优]&#10;  D --&gt; F[点交换算法&lt;br/&gt;多随机起点]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[迭代换点提升准则]&#10;  G --&gt; H{还能提升?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| G&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[输出定制设计矩阵]&#10;  I --&gt; J[可处理: 不规则区域&lt;br/&gt;混合因素 非2幂运行数]\">flowchart TD\n  A[指定模型项&lt;br/&gt;+ 运行数 n + 约束] --&gt; B[选最优性准则]\n  B --&gt; C{关心什么?}\n  C --&gt;|估准系数/筛选| D[D-最优]\n  C --&gt;|预测准/找最优| E[I-最优]\n  D --&gt; F[点交换算法&lt;br/&gt;多随机起点]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[迭代换点提升准则]\n  G --&gt; H{还能提升?}\n  H --&gt;|是| G\n  H --&gt;|否| I[输出定制设计矩阵]\n  I --&gt; J[可处理: 不规则区域&lt;br/&gt;混合因素 非2幂运行数]</pre><h2 id=\"定义筛选设计-dsd-近十年最受关注的新设计\">定义筛选设计 DSD：近十年最受关注的新设计</h2><p>Jones 与 Nachtsheim 在 2011 年提出的<strong>定义筛选设计</strong>（DSD，definitive screening design）解决了一个长期痛点：传统筛选（<a href=\"../designs/fractional-factorial\">部分析因</a>、Plackett-Burman）只两水平、看不见曲率，而响应曲面设计运行数又太多——两者之间有个尴尬的空隙。DSD 用一座桥填上它。其结构性质堪称漂亮：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三水平连续因素，运行数只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个因素，略多于因素数两倍）；</li>\n<li>主效应<strong>不被任何二阶效应别名</strong>（无偏估计）；</li>\n<li>任意一对二阶效应<strong>互不别名</strong>；</li>\n<li>当只有三个或更少因素真正活跃时，DSD 自动「投影」成一个完整的响应曲面设计，能直接拟合二阶模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一条最关键：DSD 把筛选和优化合二为一。传统流程是「先 Plackett-Burman 筛、再 CCD 优化」两批实验，DSD 常能一批搞定——若运气好（活跃因素少），筛完直接就能拟合曲面找最优。这是它自 2011 年以来在制药、化工、食品配方领域迅速流行的原因（<a href=\"https://www.jmp.com/en/statistics-knowledge-portal/design-of-experiments/screening-designs/definitive-screening-designs\">JMP 定义筛选设计知识门户</a>）。下表把它放进谱系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>水平</th>\n<th>运行数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 因素）</th>\n<th>能否估曲率</th>\n<th>主效应是否干净</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Plackett-Burman</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（4 的倍数）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>部分别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分辨度 IV 部分析因</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 2k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（混二阶交互）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSD</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（不混任何二阶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心复合设计</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 2^k+2k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DSD 自身就常通过 D-最优思想构造（含可选的「加二级分类因素」扩展），还有处理难改因素的裂区版本，呼应 <a href=\"../designs/blocking-confounding\">区组与混杂</a> 的裂区讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该用最优设计而非经典设计\">何时该用最优设计而非经典设计</h2><p>最优设计强大，但不该无脑默认。决策线索：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>因素空间是规整立方体、运行预算宽裕、想要可旋转等良好几何性质 → 用经典 CCD/Box-Behnken（<a href=\"response-surface\">响应曲面</a>），它们经过几十年检验、性质透明。</li>\n<li>有不可行的因素组合约束、混合连续+分类因素、运行数被卡成非常规数字、或模型项是非标准的 → 用 D/I-最优定制。</li>\n<li>想用最省运行数同时完成筛选与曲率探测 → 用 DSD。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：经典设计是「好房型的样板间」，最优设计是「按地块定制的建筑」——地块规整时样板间更省心，地块奇形怪状时才值得定制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>最优设计放弃查表，由算法在信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^TX</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 的某个标量准则下直接搜出试验点。</li>\n<li>D-最优估准系数（筛选/建模）、I-最优预测最准（响应曲面），选准则即选「想估准什么」。</li>\n<li>点交换算法配行列式快速更新，使带约束、混合因素、非常规运行数的设计能秒级生成。</li>\n<li>DSD（2011）用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次试验给出三水平、主效应不混二阶、且活跃因素少时自动成 RSM 设计，合并筛选与优化。</li>\n<li>规整区域用经典设计，奇形约束或极省预算用最优设计/DSD——按地块选样板间还是定制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>DSD 取代的经典筛选设计：<a href=\"../designs/fractional-factorial\">部分析因</a></li>\n<li>I-最优契合的曲面优化目标：<a href=\"response-surface\">响应曲面</a></li>\n<li>准则优化背后的组合优化：<a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/convex-sets\">凸集</a></li>\n<li>设计准则与点估计的协方差视角：<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/statistical-inference/point-estimation\">点估计</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"最优设计","id":"最优设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"信息矩阵与最优性准则","id":"信息矩阵与最优性准则"},{"level":2,"text":"候选点交换算法","id":"候选点交换算法"},{"level":2,"text":"定义筛选设计 DSD：近十年最受关注的新设计","id":"定义筛选设计-dsd-近十年最受关注的新设计"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该用最优设计而非经典设计","id":"何时该用最优设计而非经典设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"响应曲面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/analysis/response-surface"},"next":{"title":"样本量与功效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/practice/sample-size-power"}}